OL,3,AHazardous driving conditions for Friday
OL,4,Aas fog warning issued by Met Office
OL,5,
OL,6,FThick fog has formed on Friday morning
OL,7,Facross parts of the United Kingdom
OL,8,Fwhich could lead to hazardous driving
OL,9,Fconditions.
OL,11,FThe Met Office has issued a yellow
OL,12,Fsevere weather warning for fog from
OL,13,FLincolnshire, the East Midlands, the
OL,14,FHome Counties into parts of Greater
OL,15,FLondon.
OL,17,FFog will be dense in places with
OL,18,Fvisibility below 100 metres at times
OL,19,Fand it will be most extensive and
OL,20,Fdisruptive during the morning rush
OL,21,Fhour.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
