OL,3,AHazardous driving conditions for Friday
OL,4,Aas fog warning issued by Met Office
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will slowly begin to thin, lift and
OL,7,Fclear later this morning but in some
OL,8,Frural spots in eastern England it may
OL,9,Fnot clear until this afternoon.
